menu "Web app (webui)"

    config WEBUI_RELEASES_URL
        string "Where release channels are published"
        default "https://davidiansmith.ca/holo-player-fw/"
        help
            The documentation site, which carries each release's firmware. A channel such as
            `latest` is looked up in <this>versions.json, and its image described by
            <this><version>/firmware/manifest.json. The site's own domain, not
            daveismith.github.io: that redirects through plain http, which a pull refuses.

    config WEBUI_EVENTS_SYNC_S
        int "While a clip plays or a scene runs, send its state this often (seconds)"
        default 5
        range 1 60
        help
            The `screen` event (with the clip's frame and loop counts) and the `scene` event (with
            its time left) are sent when they change, and this often besides while a clip plays
            or a scene runs to its end, so a client that counts on by itself between events is
            put right again, however its clock or the clip's real frame rate drifts.

endmenu
